1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
A whole country that naps after lunch — smart habit, or just slacking?
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
In China, many offices dim the lights so people can nap right at their desks.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
They call it wǔxiū — the midday rest.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
It's a habit people learn young, back in school after lunch.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Think of it as a built-in siesta — and a 20-minute nap really can sharpen focus.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
So — genius routine, or an excuse to sleep at work? You decide.
